      {
        "id": 34294,
        "name": "The Orange Mailman",
        "username": "The_Orange_Mailman",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/c68b51/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-08T14:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a question about strategy with Telekinetic Cocoon.&nbsp; If cards like Wrest the Mind, Demoralization, and Twist the Ether are in play when I play Telekinetic Coccon, do the effects of those 3 cards continue?&nbsp; For instance, Visionary could go into Cocoon mode and still be causing a T-Rex to do someone else damage because Wrest the Mind is on it, but she would be immune to Psychic damage.&nbsp; Demoralization would automatically trigger because it is not a power.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Plus, while in the Cocoon, can she draw two cards each time since she is basically by-passing her turn?&nbsp; Just wondering if these are valid strategies.&nbsp; Thanks in advance.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:14.143Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
