        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-08T14:19:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, Wrest the Mind, Demoralization, and Twist the Ether will still be able to be used while in Telekinetic Cocoon. She also does draw 2 since she is not playing or using a power on her turn.</p>",
